      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2014 Canadian Cardiovascular Society. Published by Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "A patient presented with acute distal left main occlusion as a result of very late stent thrombosis of 2 drug-eluting stents. Intravascular ultrasound imaging confirmed the presence of a peri-stent aneurysm coupled with malapposition at the site of a stent fracture, reflecting an abnormal vascular response to drug-eluting stents."
      },
